Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Code for: Brain Cholesterol Handling Is Coupled to Astrocyte-Neuron Metabolic \
Support Across Stages of Alzheimer's Disease. Requires \
coreData_plusClusters.wl, built from ADNI data under the ADNI Data Use \
Agreement and not distributed here (see README.md). Evaluate Setup first, \
then any section.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"65d36b1d-7552-435a-839f-e3a24336871a"],

